      {
        "id": "t15_p1",
        "title": "Quarterly Review",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# Quarterly review\n\nThree months, three regions. The chart is placed at 60% of the text column\nso it sits under this heading rather than starting a page of its own.\n\n```columns 3 2\n### What happened\n\nVolumes held through the quarter, with **East** carrying most of the growth\nand **South** flat.\n\nThe table overleaf has the month-by-month detail behind this chart.\n---\n![[Monthly Units|width=100%]]\n```\n\n\\pagebreak\n\n## The detail\n\nEvery region and month behind the summary:\n\n![[Regional Detail]]\n\nWritten with the report page's own Page Setup \u2014 cover, margins, and the\nrunning header and footer above and below this text.\n",
        "color": null,
        "maximized_tile": null,
        "view_mode": false,
        "setup": {
          "margin_top": 20.0,
          "margin_right": 18.0,
          "margin_bottom": 20.0,
          "margin_left": 18.0,
          "cover": true,
          "cover_title": "Quarterly Review",
          "cover_subtitle": "Units by region, Jan\u2013Mar",
          "header_left": "Quarterly Review",
          "header_right": "{date}",
          "footer_center": "Page {page} of {pages}",
          "bands_on_first_page": false
        },
